{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/984170/extras/3eaa0340afc7235a91c195cf5e115baf.avif?t=1763644457\" width=630 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a mystical world of astrology and alchemy in a story-rich hidden object adventure. Search beautifully hand-drawn scenes, solve zodiac-inspired puzzles and guide Elasaid through the Seven Chambers to rewrite her destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a near-fatal accident, Elasaid falls into a coma and journeys through the depths of her subconscious. Guided by mystical beings like the Fallen Angel, Mercury and the Green Lion, she must uncover the secrets of the Seven Chambers and awaken the Azoth\u2014the power to change her fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/984170/extras/ddce480618238f4222a4af7b6bcc98c0.avif?t=1763644457\" width=630 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf Puzzle &amp; mystery adventure \u2014 dozens of unique riddles and mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f Intriguing narrative \u2014 a dramatic plot with twists and memorable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 30+ locations &amp; 20 mini-games \u2013 inspired by alchemy and the zodiac.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Map &amp; Journal \u2013 always know where to go next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 Full voiceovers &amp; HD visuals \u2013 immerse yourself in the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f 3 difficulty levels \u2013 from relaxed exploration to true challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf4 Play completely offline \u2014 anytime, anywhere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd12 No data collection \u2014 your privacy is safe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79 Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click / Tap to search scenes, collect clues, combine items from your inventory, and complete mini-games to progress the story. Use hints if you get stuck \u2014 but the reward is uncovering more of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Play your way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, investigate and solve the mystery in your own way: adjustable challenge: Casual, Adventure, and Challenging difficulty modes. Win Achievements &amp; Collectibles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c Atmospheric adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gripping mystery: narrative-driven gameplay with a strong detective lead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive locations: explore, seeks, search and solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/984170/extras/499576cf642490d2495da890393bfc20.avif?t=1763644457\" width=630 height=170 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DISCOVER pieces of your past life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UNIQUE astrological journey filled with mysticism and legends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >INVESTIGATE mysterious locations of your subconsciousness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FIND useful hidden items and objects to progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SOLVE dozens of astrology and zodiac inspired mini-games and puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SEARCH for clues and FIND HIDDEN OBJECTS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EARN achievements and COLLECT special items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ENJOY fully animated and voiced ambient</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 DIFFICULTY MODES: novice, adventure, challenge and custom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >READ the Diary along your journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use THE MAP for easier and faster navigation through the game's world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BEAUTIFUL high-definition graphics</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"89a050c57efd09ed7dd96f6d8fa1714abda7f318.jpg","localized_name":"Adventurer","name":"Adventurer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/984170/89a050c57efd09ed7dd96f6d8fa1714abda7f318.jpg"},{"icon":"ff01f9ad31f7821b6764c02949839978e4c97707.jpg","localized_name":"Hero","name":"Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/984170/ff01f9ad31f7821b6764c02949839978e4c97707.jpg"},{"icon":"cb2803129112aff46ef9b5cd2c5c68c4ee9b1180.jpg","localized_name":"Chosen One","name":"Chosen One","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/984170/cb2803129112aff46ef9b5cd2c5c68c4ee9b1180.jpg"},{"icon":"2faea936f00a473791c3282ad51f8ee86be81dd4.jpg","localized_name":"Minigame Genius","name":"Minigame Genius","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/984170/2faea936f00a473791c3282ad51f8ee86be81dd4.jpg"},{"icon":"8200e97591bb65525b7af6801e13aa08fa58119b.jpg","localized_name":"Minigame Player","name":"Minigame Player","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/984170/8200e97591bb65525b7af6801e13aa08fa58119b.jpg"},{"icon":"1f2ec29f6aee6486d68502788feeb689e22db2e0.jpg","localized_name":"Minigame Solver","name":"Minigame Solver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/984170/1f2ec29f6aee6486d68502788feeb689e22db2e0.jpg"},{"icon":"04eb231945d8d95d1bc4844e24edf3726604ca3d.jpg","localized_name":"Minigame Expert","name":"Minigame Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/pub